{
  "info": {
    "name": "viva-api BFF — Landing + Viva webhooks",
    "description": "Коллекция для сервиса **viva-api** (`cmd/viva-api/main.go`).\n\n**Лендинг:** `POST /landing/init-subscription` → Viva InitSubscription; `POST /landing/confirm-subscription` → Viva ConfirmSubscription + `order/create` (NATS).\n\n**MSISDN:** заголовки `X-MSISDN` / `X-Msisdn` / `X-Phone-Number` или поле `phoneNum` в JSON (`internal/app/landing.go`).\n\n**Конфиг:** `extTransport` (HTTP), `extTransport.secret` (вебхуки), `vivaApi` (baseURL, userName, password) — см. `config/viva-api.yaml`.\n\n**Вебхуки:** `X-Signature` = HMAC-SHA256 hex от тела JSON + секрет из `extTransport.secret`.\n\n**Папка «0. Viva REST»** — прямые вызовы Viva (отладка, тот же контракт, что `internal/vivaclient`).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "noauth"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "bff_base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:4000",
      "description": "HTTP viva-api (extTransport.server), локально :4000"
    },
    {
      "key": "viva_base_url",
      "value": "https://viva.zsquare.ru/api/rest",
      "description": "Базовый URL Viva Ext-App REST (vivaApi.baseURL)"
    },
    {
      "key": "viva_username",
      "value": "",
      "description": "vivaApi.userName → POST .../auth/token"
    },
    {
      "key": "viva_password",
      "value": "",
      "description": "vivaApi.password"
    },
    {
      "key": "viva_token",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Заполняется запросом «Get Access Token»"
    },
    {
      "key": "msisdn",
      "value": "37493215362",
      "description": "Тестовый номер абонента"
    },
    {
      "key": "product_name",
      "value": "SAFEKID",
      "description": "productName для Init/Confirm (Viva Subscription API)"
    },
    {
      "key": "otp_code",
      "value": "",
      "description": "OTP из SMS → Confirm"
    },
    {
      "key": "webhook_secret",
      "value": "TestSecretKey",
      "description": "Первый элемент extTransport.secret в config/viva-api.yaml"
    },
    {
      "key": "webhook_signature",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Считается pre-request скриптом папки «2. Viva → BFF webhooks»"
    },
    {
      "key": "webhook_product_code",
      "value": "SAFEKID",
      "description": "productCode для вебхуков и Confirm — externalId продукта в SDS (order/create Items.ExternalId), не accountId"
    },
    {
      "key": "viva_sub_no",
      "value": "0",
      "description": "subNo из GetSubscriberInfo — для AddTariffPlanProduct"
    },
    {
      "key": "viva_tp_prod_id",
      "value": "0",
      "description": "prodId в TpProductDTO"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Viva REST — прямые вызовы",
      "description": "Прямые запросы к Viva: сначала **Get Access Token**, затем методы с `Authorization: Bearer {{viva_token}}`. Повторяет контракт `internal/vivaclient` (Init/Confirm — query-параметры).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Access Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('viva_token', jsonData.access_token);",
                  "    console.log('viva_token сохранён');",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.error('Ошибка: ' + pm.response.text());",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userName\": \"{{viva_username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{viva_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{viva_base_url}}/auth/token",
            "description": "Тот же контракт, что `vivaclient` → `POST {baseURL}/auth/token`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GetSubscriberInfo",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{viva_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{viva_base_url}}/api/Subscriber/{{msisdn}}",
            "description": "Не проксируется BFF; только для отладки на стенде Viva."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Ping API (OPTIONS /auth/token)",
          "request": {
            "method": "OPTIONS",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{viva_base_url}}/auth/token",
            "description": "Проверка доступности API без выдачи токена."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "AddTariffPlanProduct",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{viva_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"tpProduct\": {\n    \"msisdn\": \"{{msisdn}}\",\n    \"subNo\": {{viva_sub_no}},\n    \"expDate\": null,\n    \"prodId\": {{viva_tp_prod_id}}\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{viva_base_url}}/api/Subscriber/AddTariffPlanProduct",
            "description": "Обновите viva_sub_no / viva_tp_prod_id после GetSubscriberInfo."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "AddChargeableProduct",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{viva_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"tpProduct\": {\n    \"msisdn\": \"{{msisdn}}\",\n    \"subNo\": {{viva_sub_no}},\n    \"prodName\": \"{{product_name}}\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{viva_base_url}}/api/Subscriber/AddChargeableProduct",
            "description": "Прямой вызов Viva; BFF не использует."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GetProductsByPhoneNum",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{viva_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{viva_base_url}}/api/Subscription/GetProductsByPhoneNum?phoneNum={{msisdn}}",
            "description": "Список подписок по номеру."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "InitSubscription (query)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{viva_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{viva_base_url}}/api/Subscription/InitSubscription?phoneNum={{msisdn}}&productName={{product_name}}",
            "description": "Тот же вызов, что делает BFF через `vivaclient.InitSubscription`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "ConfirmSubscription (query)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{viva_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{viva_base_url}}/api/Subscription/ConfirmSubscription?phoneNum={{msisdn}}&productName={{product_name}}&otp={{otp_code}}",
            "description": "Заполните otp_code после Init. BFF дополнительно создаёт order при resultCode=0."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "RemoveSubscription (query)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 && data.resultCode === 0) {",
                  "    console.log('Подписка удалена');",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.warn('Ошибка: ' + pm.response.text());",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{viva_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{viva_base_url}}/api/Subscription/RemoveSubscription?phoneNum={{msisdn}}&productName={{product_name}}",
            "description": "Снимает подписку на стенде — после успеха можно снова Init."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Landing BFF (viva-api)",
      "description": "Маршруты из `internal/app/instance.go`:\n- `POST /landing/init-subscription` → `LandingInitHandler`\n- `POST /landing/confirm-subscription` → `LandingConfirmHandler`\n\nБез Bearer. Обязательные поля: Init — `productName`; Confirm — `productName`, `otp`, `productCode`. Номер — заголовок MSISDN или `phoneNum`. Ответ Confirm: `{ confirm, orderId }`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Init — Header Enrichment (X-MSISDN)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "console.log('Status:', pm.response.code, pm.response.text());"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-MSISDN",
                "value": "{{msisdn}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"productName\": \"{{product_name}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{bff_base_url}}/landing/init-subscription",
            "description": "MSISDN только в заголовке. Далее Confirm с otp и productCode."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Init — phoneNum в JSON",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var code = pm.response.code;",
                  "console.log('Status:', code, pm.response.text());",
                  "if (code === 200) { try { console.log(pm.response.json()); } catch (e) {} }"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phoneNum\": \"{{msisdn}}\",\n  \"productName\": \"{{product_name}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{bff_base_url}}/landing/init-subscription",
            "description": "Без X-MSISDN — номер в теле. 503 если vivaApi.baseURL не задан."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Confirm с OTP",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "console.log('Status:', pm.response.code, pm.response.text());"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phoneNum\": \"{{msisdn}}\",\n  \"productName\": \"{{product_name}}\",\n  \"otp\": \"{{otp_code}}\",\n  \"productCode\": \"{{webhook_product_code}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{bff_base_url}}/landing/confirm-subscription",
            "description": "После успешного Viva Confirm (resultCode=0) создаётся order/create через NATS."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Confirm — X-MSISDN + OTP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-MSISDN",
                "value": "{{msisdn}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"productName\": \"{{product_name}}\",\n  \"otp\": \"{{otp_code}}\",\n  \"productCode\": \"{{webhook_product_code}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{bff_base_url}}/landing/confirm-subscription",
            "description": "Номер из заголовка, без phoneNum в JSON."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Viva → BFF webhooks (X-Signature)",
      "description": "Подпись **X-Signature** = HMAC-SHA256 hex (lower) от **того же JSON**, что в теле, и `{{webhook_secret}}` (= `extTransport.secret`). Pre-request считает подпись и upsert заголовка.",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const secret = pm.collectionVariables.get('webhook_secret');",
              "if (!secret) { throw new Error('Задайте webhook_secret (extTransport.secret)'); }",
              "let rawBody = pm.request.body ? (pm.request.body.raw || '') : '';",
              "if (typeof pm.variables.replaceIn === 'function') {",
              "    rawBody = pm.variables.replaceIn(rawBody);",
              "} else {",
              "    ['msisdn', 'webhook_product_code'].forEach((k) => {",
              "        const v = pm.collectionVariables.get(k);",
              "        if (v !== undefined && v !== null) {",
              "            rawBody = rawBody.split('{{' + k + '}}').join(v);",
              "        }",
              "    });",
              "}",
              "const sig = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(rawBody, secret).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('webhook_signature', sig);",
              "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Signature', value: sig });"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "ExtAppPartneerProductActivationRequest",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Signature",
                "value": "{{webhook_signature}}",
                "description": "Подставляется pre-request скриптом папки"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phoneNum\": \"{{msisdn}}\",\n  \"productCode\": \"{{webhook_product_code}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{bff_base_url}}/ExtAppPartneerProductActivationRequest",
            "description": "OrderTypeNew — новая подписка (опечатка Partneer в пути — как в Viva spec)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "ExtAppPartneerProductActivation (Renew)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Signature",
                "value": "{{webhook_signature}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phoneNum\": \"{{msisdn}}\",\n  \"productCode\": \"{{webhook_product_code}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{bff_base_url}}/ExtAppPartneerProductActivation",
            "description": "OrderTypeRenew — продление."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "ExtAppPartneerProductRemove",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Signature",
                "value": "{{webhook_signature}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phoneNum\": \"{{msisdn}}\",\n  \"productCode\": \"{{webhook_product_code}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{bff_base_url}}/ExtAppPartneerProductRemove",
            "description": "OrderTypeCancel — отключение."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
